hran_file_operations
=============

Library for files operations.
For example: parse scf, perform operations on remote file.



Requirements
============


* Python>=2.7.10



Installation
============


Test lines with HRAN workspace
------------------------------


pip install -U hran_file_operations


Test lines without HRAN workspace
---------------------------------


pip install -U -i https://pypi.dynamic.nsn-net.net/panda/pypi hran_file_operations
